            <ArticleTitle>[Errors in the diagnosis of a cardial syndrome in reflux esophagitis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cases of diagnosis of angina pectoris and myocardial infarction erroneously made in patients suffering from reflux esophagitis are reported. The description and analysis are given of the causes underlying the above misdiagnosis and clinical manifestations of reflux esophagitis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
